        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "On the circle.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x^2+y^2&=4^2+0^2\\\\x^2+y^2&=16\\end{align*}$$\nSince the result is $16$, the point lies on the circle.",
